# __NAME__

On the stack: mise for tasks and tools, fnox for secrets, hk for checks,
packslip for releases, `dev` for every stage of every command.

The manual is the tooling: `mise tasks` lists every task and what it does,
`dev` lists every verb, and [the dev skill](https://github.com/joeblew999/dev/blob/main/skills/dev/SKILL.md)
is the same for Claude Code, linked into `.claude/skills/dev` by `mise install`.
`mise install`, then `mise run test`. AGENTS.md has the rest.
